---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Arrest and Detention Rights under BNSS | Rajendra Criminal Law Firm" description="General information on rights during arrest and detention.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <p class="text-gold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Blog</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-navy mb-6">Arrest and Detention Rights under BNSS</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg text-ink/90 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>Persons under arrest have certain procedural rights under the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita. This article provides general information only and does not constitute legal advice.</p>
      <p>These include the right to be informed of the grounds of arrest, the right to consult an advocate of choice, and production before a Magistrate within the prescribed time.</p>
      <p>For case-specific guidance, consult a qualified advocate.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-navy/10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-navy mb-4">Related</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/practice/bail" class="text-navy hover:text-crimson">Bail & Anticipatory Bail</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact" class="text-navy hover:text-crimson">Contact the Firm</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
